This file lists the licence of every third-party package Kairo depends on,
every external program it runs, and every project it borrows code from.
tests/test_notice.py fails if uv.lock holds a package version that is not
listed under "Python packages", so a dependency's licence gets looked at
again whenever it changes. Each licence was read from the package's own
licence file, or from its metadata where the file says the same or is
missing, as noted.


